title: "terrasim: wheel-terrain interaction for Gazebo Harmonic"
abstract: "Research simulator of wheel-terrain interaction for wheeled mobile robots: Janosi traction, rolling losses, Bekker soft layers and heterogeneous surfaces, DC motors, encoders and IMU; a Gazebo Harmonic system plugin and an offline emulator sharing one header-only C++ core."
